# 🔄 Changing Position Game

An interactive list-manipulation game. Start with `[0, 1, 2]`, pick a position `0/1/2`, replace it with your own text, repeat until you quit with `N`.

## Run
```bash
jupyter notebook "Changing Position Game.ipynb"
```
> Uses `IPython.display.clear_output` — best in Jupyter.

## Concepts
`functions` · list indexing · `input()` validation · game loop · `clear_output`

